WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.600
[Soft synthesized music throughout, no speech]
Clairlune: cozy landscapes drawn in text, living on your desktop.

00:06.700 --> 00:11.600
A new scene every hour: fjords, lighthouses, giant mushrooms and more.

00:11.700 --> 00:16.600
Clawd lives in each one: reading, fishing, stargazing, or just breathing.

00:16.700 --> 00:21.600
Weather that belongs to its place: sky lanterns rise over a lake at night.

00:21.700 --> 00:26.600
In the palette you like: city rooftops in Tokyo Night.

00:26.700 --> 00:31.600
Drawn in other letters: mountains in blocks, with a snowman.

00:31.700 --> 00:36.600
Some scenes go on a journey: the land drifts by under a balloon.

00:36.700 --> 00:41.600
Live behind your icons, resting while a window fills the screen.

00:41.700 --> 00:46.600
Make it yours: the letter sets and the monitor arrangement in Settings.

00:46.700 --> 00:50.000
Light on your computer.

00:50.100 --> 00:55.800
Clairlune. Living ASCII wallpapers for Windows and macOS. Free and open source.
